/T (Recent observations have significantly reduced the estimated probability of asteroid 2024 YR4 impacting Earth on December 22, 2032, from 3.1% to a mere 0.001%. Consequently, the European Space Agency has lowered the threat level on the Torino Impact Hazard Scale to zero. Despite the minimal risk, the James Webb Space Telescope is scheduled to observe the asteroid in the coming months to gather more data.)
