/T (Do you have enough layers to be outdoors for several hours? You would be surprised  how cold it can get when sitting or standing still behind a telescope!  Are your batteries fully charged? If your telescope runs on power, be sure to charge  everything before you leave home and pack any additional batteries for your cell phone.  Most people use their mobile devices for astronomy apps, so their batteries may deplete  faster. Cold weather can also impact battery life. )
